                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "All findings below should be interpreted against a shared baseline of broadly comparable severity, system-wide unplanned intake, and structurally segmented reimbursement exposure.",
